CulturalRiddles data terms

These terms apply to the benchmark data and released annotations, responses,
verdicts, and aggregate data in this reproduction bundle. They do not apply to
the repository's own code, which is licensed under Apache-2.0 in ../LICENSE,
or to separately credited third-party assets.

The project's existing data policy combines the attribution terms of Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International with the additional evaluation-only
restriction below. The combined policy is custom; it is not unmodified
CC-BY-4.0 and must not be labeled as unmodified CC-BY-4.0.

Attribution terms

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Credit CulturalRiddles and its contributors, link to the dataset and these
terms, and indicate any changes. Dataset:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/CohereLabsCommunity/CulturalRiddles

Additional evaluation-only restriction

This data must not be used to train, fine-tune, or distill models, nor as
seeds for synthetic data generation. It is an evaluation benchmark. Using
it as training data defeats its purpose and contaminates future measurement.

This file records the existing project policy; it does not remove or narrow
rights already granted under an earlier release. The additional restriction
is not a condition in the standard Creative Commons license. No claim is made
here that adding this notice changes an existing Creative Commons grant.
